WEBVTT

00:00:14.017 --> 00:00:15.477
How could my mother tell him

00:00:15.560 --> 00:00:17.687
about this town of bloodthirsty lunatics?

00:00:17.770 --> 00:00:19.856
I still can't believe he would do this.

00:00:19.939 --> 00:00:20.940
It's not like him.

00:00:21.024 --> 00:00:22.192
Just keep your guard up.

00:00:22.275 --> 00:00:23.693
There's gonna be land monsters everywhere.

00:00:23.776 --> 00:00:25.487
-(GASPS AND YELLS)
-(GRUNTS)

00:00:25.570 --> 00:00:28.531
-Daniela! Ooh! Wait! Ow! Ow!
-No! Not today, land monster!

00:00:28.615 --> 00:00:30.116
-It's me!
-Oh!

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:31.701
You scared the scales off of me!

00:00:31.784 --> 00:00:33.077
Jeez, you're strong!

00:00:33.161 --> 00:00:34.454
I'm sorry, I'm just a little on edge.

00:00:34.537 --> 00:00:37.457
No. I needed that. It really woke me up.

00:00:37.624 --> 00:00:40.460
Wow! We look horrifying.

00:00:40.543 --> 00:00:42.003
Ugh, gross.

00:00:42.086 --> 00:00:43.880
Come on. Let's find our son.

00:00:43.963 --> 00:00:45.340
-(MAN WHISTLING MELODY)
-(GASPS)

00:00:45.423 --> 00:00:47.217
(BOTH PANT AND GRUNT)

00:00:49.844 --> 00:00:51.137
(BIRDS CHIRPING)

00:00:51.221 --> 00:00:52.305
(YAWNS)

00:00:52.889 --> 00:00:54.015
(SMACKS LIPS)

00:01:00.146 --> 00:01:03.024
(GASPS) Oh, no! Oh, no!
Alberto! Wake up!

00:01:03.107 --> 00:01:04.943
What? Ahh! The sky's been leaking!

00:01:05.026 --> 00:01:07.320
(MIMICKING BUGLE PLAYING WAKEUP CALL)

00:01:08.738 --> 00:01:09.781
(BOTH GASP)

00:01:10.907 --> 00:01:12.408
(BOTH PANTING)

00:01:14.118 --> 00:01:16.162
(MACHIAVELLI GROWLING)

00:01:16.246 --> 00:01:18.081
(CONTINUES MIMICKING WAKEUP CALL)

00:01:18.164 --> 00:01:20.041
Hmm. Uh...

00:01:20.124 --> 00:01:21.376
Oh. There you are!

00:01:21.668 --> 00:01:23.211
(CHUCKLES) Buongiorno.

00:01:23.294 --> 00:01:24.420
All right, ragazzi.

00:01:24.504 --> 00:01:26.464
You want that entry fee,
you got to earn it.

00:01:26.548 --> 00:01:27.549
-Giulietta...
-I'm on it!

00:01:27.632 --> 00:01:30.009
-...you make the deliveries.
-Already makin' 'em! Ciao!

00:01:30.093 --> 00:01:32.178
Hmm. You two are coming with me.

00:01:32.262 --> 00:01:33.263
-LUCA: Oh.
-(GASPS)

00:01:33.346 --> 00:01:35.140
Which knife do I get? Huh? Huh?

00:01:35.223 --> 00:01:36.516
You don't.

00:01:38.309 --> 00:01:39.686
TOMMASO: Buongiorno, Massimo!

00:01:39.769 --> 00:01:42.355
You'll keep an eye out
for those sea monsters, right?

00:01:42.438 --> 00:01:43.815
We're all counting on you.

00:01:43.898 --> 00:01:46.943
Don't worry, Tommaso.
I've got my eyes peeled.

00:01:47.026 --> 00:01:48.444
They won't get away.

00:01:48.695 --> 00:01:49.821
(LUCA LAUGHS NERVOUSLY)

00:01:49.904 --> 00:01:51.364
-(WATER SPLASHES)
-(LUCA GASPS)

00:01:52.031 --> 00:01:53.324
(MACHIAVELLI GRUMBLES)

00:01:54.492 --> 00:01:55.869
-(BOAT CREAKING)
-(BOTH GASP)

00:01:56.536 --> 00:01:57.704
(LUCA YELPS)

00:01:57.787 --> 00:01:59.831
Hey, this isn't a joyride.

00:01:59.914 --> 00:02:01.332
Make yourselves useful.

00:02:04.127 --> 00:02:05.753
(MACHIAVELLI GROWLING)

00:02:08.590 --> 00:02:09.591
Uh...

00:02:10.049 --> 00:02:11.468
(YELPS AND WHIMPERS)

00:02:11.551 --> 00:02:12.677
-(GROWLS)
-(LUCA GASPS)

00:02:12.760 --> 00:02:14.304
-(YOWLING)
-(LUCA GRUNTING)

00:02:14.387 --> 00:02:16.639
MASSIMO: Hey,
no goofing around back there.

00:02:16.723 --> 00:02:17.932
-(GRUNTS)
-(MACHIAVELLI YOWLS)

00:02:18.016 --> 00:02:19.642
-(WATER SPLASHES)
-(LUCA GASPS AND WHIMPERS)

00:02:20.268 --> 00:02:21.853
(GROWLING)

00:02:26.858 --> 00:02:27.984
(GRUNTS SOFTLY)

00:02:38.828 --> 00:02:40.455
A sea monster ate it.

00:02:40.830 --> 00:02:41.956
Huh? What?

00:02:42.457 --> 00:02:46.461
(CHUCKLES) Ma, no.
This is how I came into the world.

00:02:48.463 --> 00:02:49.672
(GRUNTING)

00:02:51.841 --> 00:02:52.842
Whoa.

00:02:52.926 --> 00:02:55.595
Mannaggia, not a great catch today.

00:02:55.678 --> 00:02:59.140
It might be because we're
over a haunted fish graveyard.

00:02:59.224 --> 00:03:02.101
We know it's not haunted.
The fish think it's haunted.

00:03:02.185 --> 00:03:05.855
This time of day, most fish
will be right about there.

00:03:07.148 --> 00:03:08.274
MASSIMO: Hmm.

00:03:10.068 --> 00:03:11.528
BOTH: Ciao, Giulia.
GIULIA: Ciao.

00:03:12.237 --> 00:03:13.238
(GRUNTS)

00:03:13.947 --> 00:03:15.114
(GASPS) Ha-ha!

00:03:15.198 --> 00:03:16.491
New personal best!

00:03:16.950 --> 00:03:18.952
(GASPS) Santo pecorino.

00:03:19.035 --> 00:03:20.245
ALBERTO: Shoo! Shoo!

00:03:22.372 --> 00:03:24.833
Your friends do know fish.

00:03:25.083 --> 00:03:28.044
(LAUGHS) Benissimo!
Ooh, let's go sign up.

00:03:34.801 --> 00:03:35.844
Okay. Okay.

00:03:35.927 --> 00:03:37.762
Now, what's our plan? Think, Daniela.

00:03:37.846 --> 00:03:39.806
Hey, everything's always on you.

00:03:39.889 --> 00:03:41.141
I wanna step up.

00:03:41.224 --> 00:03:44.936
-Uh... You sure?
-Oh, yeah. I got this.

00:03:46.813 --> 00:03:49.149
Oh, hello there, young man.

00:03:49.232 --> 00:03:51.151
-You're not fooling anyone.
-Lorenzo, eh-eh.

00:03:51.234 --> 00:03:53.278
Did you really think
you could get away with this?

00:03:53.361 --> 00:03:55.488
-Renzo...
-You thought we wouldn't find you?

00:03:55.572 --> 00:03:56.823
-Well, guess what?
-I don't think...

00:03:56.906 --> 00:03:58.741
It's time for us to go home.

00:03:58.825 --> 00:03:59.826
(KID YELPS)

00:04:02.745 --> 00:04:03.788
(PANTS)

00:04:05.039 --> 00:04:06.291
(WHIMPERS)

00:04:06.374 --> 00:04:07.959
(SOBBING LOUDLY)

00:04:08.042 --> 00:04:10.336
(FUMBLES FOR WORDS)
Let that be a lesson to you!

00:04:10.420 --> 00:04:12.589
Go, go, go! Run before
its mother gets here!

00:04:13.548 --> 00:04:15.133
It turns out I don't got this.

00:04:15.216 --> 00:04:18.303
No, but I do. I'll know my son when I...

00:04:18.928 --> 00:04:20.263
(INDISTINCT CHATTERING)

00:04:21.306 --> 00:04:22.515
...see him.

00:04:23.016 --> 00:04:24.225
Ah, sharks.

00:04:24.309 --> 00:04:27.061
Grazie, Papà!
Come on, we'd better hurry.

00:04:27.145 --> 00:04:29.063
-ALBERTO: Okay.
-(KIDS LAUGHING)

00:04:31.357 --> 00:04:32.609
WOMAN: Fellow Portorossans!

00:04:33.193 --> 00:04:35.695
It is I, Giorgio Giorgioni!

00:04:35.862 --> 00:04:40.492
Slayer of sea monsters
and beloved purveyor of pasta!

00:04:40.575 --> 00:04:42.118
Slayer of sea monsters?

00:04:42.202 --> 00:04:44.204
Ah, that's just Signora Marsigliese.

00:04:44.287 --> 00:04:46.080
She works for the sponsor for the race.

00:04:46.164 --> 00:04:48.041
(SIGHS) This is gonna take forever.

00:04:48.124 --> 00:04:49.709
The finest pasta in Liguria

00:04:49.792 --> 00:04:51.836
at a price every family can afford.

00:04:51.920 --> 00:04:53.213
Get to the rules!

00:04:53.296 --> 00:04:56.174
Enthusiasm. Love to see it.

00:04:56.257 --> 00:04:57.967
To win my famous race,

00:04:58.051 --> 00:05:00.386
your team must be the first to brave

00:05:00.470 --> 00:05:02.180
the treacherous waters of the bay,

00:05:02.263 --> 00:05:04.891
devour a mystery bowl
of my delicious pasta,

00:05:04.974 --> 00:05:08.520
and ride to the top
of Mount Portorosso and back!

00:05:08.603 --> 00:05:10.188
That all sounds pretty hard.

00:05:10.271 --> 00:05:13.107
Yeah. Hard to lose. We're going to win.

00:05:13.191 --> 00:05:14.275
I love your confidence.

00:05:14.359 --> 00:05:16.027
But don't forget, we're going
to have to go through...

00:05:16.110 --> 00:05:17.487
Champion coming through.

00:05:17.570 --> 00:05:19.197
-GIULIA: Ugh.
-Ciao, ciao! Hey!

00:05:19.280 --> 00:05:20.281
Ercole.

00:05:20.782 --> 00:05:22.617
Aren't you a little old, Ercole?

00:05:22.700 --> 00:05:24.410
Signora! I am 16.

00:05:24.494 --> 00:05:25.912
You said that last year.

00:05:25.995 --> 00:05:27.372
But this year, it's true.

